# Build context of apps/web/Dockerfile: the repository root. Never exclude apps, packages or services
# (the frozen install needs every importer), and never packages/db/drizzle (shipped in the image).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/playwright/.auth
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts
.git
# Docker anchors patterns at the context root, and standalone output copies apps/web/.env* into the
# image, so root-only patterns would ship app-level env files.
**/.env
**/.env.*
# A registry token or a key file must never reach the build context.
**/.npmrc
**/*.pem
**/*.key
.claude
backlog
plans
pipeline
learner
docs
design
scripts
tests
# course/ is in the context on purpose: the build stage exports the learner-visible files with
# apps/web/scripts/export-course.ts and deletes course/ before next build (ADR-0009).
